<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4 Further Analysis ‣ In-Context Reinforcement Learning for Tool Use in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3 </span>Generalize</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In In-Context Reinforcement Learning for Tool Use in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
